OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal after 'patterned holes' dug
OL,4,Aon golf course
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Patterned holes of varying sizes" were
OL,7,Fdug on a golf course causing thousands
OL,8,Fof pounds worth of damage, a club has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police said officers
OL,12,Fwere called to reports of damage to
OL,13,Fseven greens at Bondhay Golf Club, in
OL,14,FWorksop, caused in the early hours of
OL,15,FSunday, between midnight and 05:30 BST.
OL,17,FThe club said in a statement this would
OL,18,Fcause "severe disruption" to golfers
OL,19,Ffor a "number of weeks".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
